{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48820","headline":"青阳馆望九子山 · 窦叔向","name":"青阳馆望九子山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苍翠迢嶢上碧天，九峰遥落县门前。\n毫芒映日千重树，涓滴垂空万丈泉。\n武帝南游曾驻跸，始皇东幸亦祈年。\n云祠绝迹终难访，唯有猨声到客边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦叔向","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48820.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48820","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}